---@field useMaterializedViews? boolean|distilled.Null
---@field useNewEventsSchema? boolean|distilled.Null Read events from the native JSON events table (`true`) or the legacy events table (`false`). When unset, a staff person's `ph_new_events_schema` cookie applies, then the project's listing in the `CLICKHOUSE_HOGQL_USE_NEW_EVENTS_SCHEMA_TEAMS` instance setting, then the `CLICKHOUSE_HOGQL_USE_NEW_EVENTS_SCHEMA` instance setting. This is an internal rollout switch, and the project settings API ignores it.
---@field usePreaggregatedIntermediateResults? boolean|distilled.Null
---@field usePreaggregatedTableTransforms? boolean|distilled.Null Try to automatically convert HogQL queries to use preaggregated tables at the AST level *
