---@class posthog.insights.ListInsightsRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field basic? boolean Return basic insight metadata only (no results, faster).
---@field created_by? string JSON-encoded array of user IDs. Only returns insights whose `created_by` is in the list, e.g. `[1,42]`.
---@field created_date_from? string Filter by `created_at > created_date_from`. Accepts absolute or relative dates.
---@field created_date_to? string Filter by `created_at < created_date_to`. Accepts absolute or relative dates.
---@field dashboards? string JSON-encoded array of dashboard IDs. Returns insights attached to every listed dashboard (AND).
---@field date_from? string Filter by `last_modified_at > date_from`. Accepts absolute dates (`2025-04-23`) or relative strings (`-7d`, `-1m`).
---@field date_to? string Filter by `last_modified_at < date_to`. Accepts absolute dates or relative strings.
---@field display? string Comma-separated chart types, e.g. `ActionsLineGraph,ActionsBar`. Only returns trends and SQL insights shown as one of them. A trends insight with no chart type set counts as `ActionsLineGraph`.
---@field exclude_bi? boolean Exclude Business intelligence worksheets from the insight list.
---@field favorited? boolean Include this parameter (any value) to restrict results to insights marked as favorited.
---@field format? posthog.insights.ListInsightsRequestFormat|string
---@field include_dashboards? boolean Opt in to receiving the deprecated `dashboards` field in insight payloads. Once opt-in enforcement is enabled, API-token callers stop receiving it by default; use `dashboard_tiles` instead.
---@field insight? posthog.insights.ListInsightsRequestInsight|string Restrict to a single insight type. `JSON` matches non-wrapper query insights; `SQL` matches HogQL queries; `BI` matches editable worksheets.
---@field last_viewed_date_from? string Filter by `last_viewed_at > last_viewed_date_from`. Accepts absolute or relative dates.
---@field last_viewed_date_to? string Filter by `last_viewed_at < last_viewed_date_to`. Accepts absolute or relative dates.
---@field limit? number Number of results to return per page.
---@field offset? number The initial index from which to return the results.
---@field order? string Sort by an insight field, with a leading minus for descending order. Supports last_modified_at and last_viewed_at.
---@field refresh? posthog.insights.ListInsightsRequestRefresh|string Whether to refresh the retrieved insights, how aggressively, and if sync or async: - `'force_cache'` - return cached data or a cache miss; always completes immediately as it never calculates - `'blocking'` - calculate synchronously (returning only when the query is done), UNLESS there are very fresh results in the cache - `'async'` - kick off background calculation (returning immediately with a query status), UNLESS there are very fresh results in the cache - `'lazy_async'` - kick off background calculation, UNLESS there are somewhat fresh results in the cache - `'force_blocking'` - calculate synchronously, even if fresh results are already cached - `'force_async'` - kick off background calculation, even if fresh results are already cached Background calculation can be tracked using the `query_status` response field.
---@field saved? boolean When truthy, restricts results to insights that are saved (or attached to a visible dashboard). When falsy, only unsaved insights.
---@field search? string Search term matched across name, derived_name, description, and tag names. Returns exact (case-insensitive substring) matches only; if no exact match exists, returns similar (fuzzy trigram) matches instead. Each result's `search_match_type` is `exact` or `similar`.
---@field short_id? string
---@field tags? string JSON-encoded array of tag names. Returns insights with any of the listed tags.
---@field user? boolean Include this parameter (any value) to restrict results to insights created by the authenticated user.

---@alias posthog.insights.ListInsightsRequestFormat "csv"|"json"

---@alias posthog.insights.ListInsightsRequestInsight "BI"|"FUNNELS"|"JOURNEYS"|"JSON"|"LIFECYCLE"|"PATHS"|"RETENTION"|"SQL"|"STICKINESS"|"TRENDS"

---@alias posthog.insights.ListInsightsRequestRefresh "async"|"async_except_on_cache_miss"|"blocking"|"force_async"|"force_blocking"|"force_cache"|"lazy_async"

